{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $16a+72$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $4$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}16a+72\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{16a+72}{4}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{16a}{4}+\\dfrac{72}{4}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4(4a+18)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $16a+72$ is equivalent to $4(4a+18)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $8$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}16a+72\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8\\left(\\dfrac{16a+72}{8}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8\\left(\\dfrac{16a}{8}+\\dfrac{72}{8}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8(2a+9)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $16a+72$ is equivalent to $8(2a+9)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}16a+72\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{16a+72}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{16a}{2}+\\dfrac{72}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(8a+36)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $16a+72$ is *not* equivalent to $2(8+36a)$ or to $2(8a+72)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $16a+72$:\n\n- $4(4a+18)$\n- $8(2a+9)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $16a+72$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $16a+72$.","content":"$4(4a+18)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $16a+72$.","content":"$8(2a+9)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $16+72a$.","content":"$2(8+36a)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $16a+144$.","content":"$2(8a+72)$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
